      "created_at": "2015-04-28T01:56:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Time for another \"My Turn\" event. This time, we want to have every hero defeat every villain that is in the app. When you win a game, simply put it into <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1hABR4n5KXBEvKLWvzzHHKVAPGKuYf-J2IA_uLt8UC0c/viewform\">this form</a>. You can see who still needs to beat which villain <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1e9uOr7iEjI4CvUK1l4qyHRD-Fz1zJfMHBY3biPOeZ6A/edit?usp=sharing\">here</a>. In the spreadsheet, I have it create random teams with the heroes left for each matchup, just in case you need some help deciding who to play as. Post any question, comments, or session reports below. Have fun!</p><p>NOTE: The random teams may put two variants on the same team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Links</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1hABR4n5KXBEvKLWvzzHHKVAPGKuYf-J2IA_uLt8UC0c/viewform\">Form</a></p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1e9uOr7iEjI4CvUK1l4qyHRD-Fz1zJfMHBY3biPOeZ6A/edit?usp=sharing\">Sheet</a></p>",
